Package: resonance
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: sudo-megas <sudo-megas@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/sudo-megas/RESONANCE
Description: Dotfile syncing that is for "users" not developers
 RESONANCE mirrors your configuration between a vault directory and the
 places it lives -- $HOME, /etc and /usr. Add an app's files once, and it
 tracks checksum-based drift, backs up changes, and restores byte-identical
 copies with a pre-restore undo snapshot. Putting a file back into /etc or
 /usr goes through a small helper and asks for administrator rights, which
 is what pkexec is here for. GPL-3.0-or-later.
